          "path": "_m/9/q/5/f/capitol-records-building-wp/capitol-records-building-in-ho.png",
          "filename": "Capitol Records Building in Hollywood.png",
          "caption": "The Capitol Records Building is a 13-story distinct landmark in Hollywood, California built in 1956 and designed by the architectural firm Welton Becket &amp; Associates.\nA Los Angeles Historic-Cultural Monument located at 1740-1750 N. Vine St. and 6236 W. Yucca St. - Hollywood.\n\nTaken by AllyUnion.",
          "alt": "The Capitol Records Building is a 13-story distinct landmark in Hollywood, California built in 1956 and designed by the architectural firm Welton Becket &amp; Associates.\nA Los Angeles Historic-Cultural Monument located at 1740-1750 N. Vine St. and 6236 W. Yucca St. - Hollywood.\n\nTaken by AllyUnion.",
          "width": 921,
          "height": 1742,
          "mimeType": "image/png",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
          "artist": "AllyUnion at English Wikipedia",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Capitol_Records_Building_in_Hollywood.png",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
