        {
          "path": "_m/9/q/5/f/capitol-records-building-wp/capitol-records-mural-1.jpg",
          "filename": "Capitol Records Mural 1.jpg",
          "caption": "\"Entitled \"Hollywood Jazz: 1945-1972\" at Capitol Records, Los Angeles, CA. Restored in hand-glazed ceramic tile, the mural is 26ft. by 88ft. This masterpiece entails “larger than life” images of: Chet Baker, Gerry Mulligan, Charlie “Bird” Parker, Tito Puente, Miles Davis, Ella Fitzgerald, Nat King Cole, Shelly Manne, Dizzy Gillespie, Billie Holiday, and Duke Ellington.",
          "alt": "\"Entitled \"Hollywood Jazz: 1945-1972\" at Capitol Records, Los Angeles, CA. Restored in hand-glazed ceramic tile, the mural is 26ft. by 88ft. This masterpiece entails “larger than life” images of: Chet Baker, Gerry Mulligan, Charlie “Bird” Parker, Tito Puente, Miles Davis, Ella Fitzgerald, Nat King Cole, Shelly Manne, Dizzy Gillespie, Billie Holiday, and Duke Ellington.",
